      "id": "youtube-api",
      "name": "YouTube Data API Integration",
      "category": "acquisition",
      "description": "Replace yt-dlp with YouTube Data API for video search, caption fetching, and enhanced metadata. Use search.list for reliable pagination, channels.list for subscriber counts, captions.list for faster caption enumeration, videos.list for topicDetails and engagement metrics. Implement quota budgeting with auto-fallback to yt-dlp when exhausted."
